<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

The module answers which document a bag's records rest in, whether a base still holds that document's history, which base stands at a path, and where HEAD stands in for a missing base; `pin` and `forgetAt` move a base. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

